"""
audiofx  —  Omarchy Audio FX  TUI
Persistent sound mode + device selector for the terminal.

State survives terminal close — re-run to see current mode and switch.
Usage:  audiofx            (interactive TUI)
        audiofx --status   (print current state and exit)
        audiofx --off      (turn off all effects and exit)
"""

